cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CyberEpi: influenza hospitalization forecasting for CDC FluSight"
authors:
  - name: "Avinash"
    email: "avianthonf@pm.me"
repository-code: "https://github.com/avianthonf/CyberEpi"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Weekly influenza hospital admission forecasts for the US and 52
  jurisdictions, submitted live to the CDC FluSight challenge for 2026-27.
  Model 1 is a SEIHDR mechanistic model with ensemble adjustment Kalman
  filter assimilation; model 2 is gradient-boosted quantile regression.
  Backtested on data as published each week (BACKTEST_RESULTS.md).
